  "body": "llmwiki 1.4.2 fixes `llmwiki compile` with the `codex-agent` provider.\n\n- In 1.4.1, concept extraction through `codex-agent` failed with `invalid_json_schema`, because Codex accepts only strict output schemas. The provider now sends Codex a strict copy of each tool schema, and optional fields keep their meaning.\n- Thanks to @frankstallone for the report and the diagnosis.\n\nNo other changes. Install `llm-wiki-compiler@1.4.2`; the supporting packages use matching versions.\n",
